  "description": "Legero is a fun, retro, bubble-style font that comes in both solid and shiny versions. It also comes with a full set of alternate characters to mix and match and give your projects a unique feel. It also includes music-themed doodles that can be accessed using uppercase and lowercase letters, as well as abstract backgrounds that work great as masks to create designs just like the ones in the screenshots.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Legero is a fun, retro, bubble-style font that comes in both solid and shiny versions. It also comes with a full set of alternate characters to mix and match and give your projects a unique feel. It also includes music-themed doodles that can be accessed using uppercase and lowercase letters, as well as abstract backgrounds that work great as masks to create designs just like the ones in the screenshots.</p>",
